		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Thousands of red-eyed rats, climbing and crawling over every surface. Malicious, formed into a hive mind.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 13, <strong>HP</strong> 35, <strong>ATK</strong> 4 bite +0 (1d6 + lycanthropy), <strong>MV</strong> near (climb, swim), <strong>S</strong> -3, <strong>D</strong> +3, <strong>C</strong> -1, <strong>I</strong> +3, <strong>W</strong> +3, <strong>Ch</strong> +1, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 8</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Lycanthropy</strong>. If 12 or more damage from the same plague swarm, contract wererat lycanthropy.</p><p></p><p><strong>Reform</strong>. Unless restoration is cast on swarm and then swarm is reduced to 0 HP, reforms in 1d4 days at full HP.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
